Hi Mike, I think you could do some kind of weighted regression on your bootstrap output as a second stage analysis, otherwise you'd need to use a fully explicit hierarchical model in BUGS to estimate stand-level relationships.  The latter approach is technically better for incorporating the uncertainty, but the former approach could provide a good approximation and allow you to still use AIC.  Either way, with only 12 stands you'd have to keep the stand-level models fairly simple (i.e., univariate relationships)

